  "reviews": [
    {
      "author": "Sierbahnn",
      "content": "Oh the production quality....\r\nDeciding not to go live-fire and to edit in muzzle flashes in post and using Styrofoam ice and backdrops that don't match the light is bad, absolutely. It makes everything else look cheaper by association. The methane-fires are even cheaper, naturally.\r\n\r\nThe casting is decent, it is not poorly paced, and decently directed, but this never rises about the level of 'decent' which also makes this very forgettable. It was not worth my time, sadly.",
      "rating": 5,
      "createdAt": "2026-05-05T10:59:27Z"
    }
  ],
